    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafilisiti bakarashanisa AbaIsiraeli babasinga; AbaIsiraeli bairuka, Abafilisiti babaitira aha Ibanga lya Giliboa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakwata Sauli n'abatabani abalimu Yonatani, Abinadabu na Malikishua babaita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endashana ekiza Sauli amani, abarasi b'emyambi bamugwamu bamuhutaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Sauli agambira omutwazi w'ebikwatobye ati, “Shohorora embanda yawe oginchumise, aba abatatahiliirwe bataija bakanjangura.” Kyonkai omutwazi w'ebikwatobye tiyaikiliize, kuba akatina muno. Aha rw'ekyo Sauli akwata embandaye nyabwe agyetungaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omutwazi w'ebikwatobye kayaboine okwo Sauli yafa, nawe kwakwo ayetunga aha mbandaye afa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo Sauli yafire atyo, wenene n'abatabani bonshatu, n'obutwazibwe bwahwa butyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo AbaIsiraeli ababaire bali omu ruhanga baboine okwo eihe lyasingwa, n'okwo Sauli n'abatabani bafa, banagaho ebigo byabo basingwa. Nikwo Abafilisiti kwija bakabituramu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeire Abafilisiti kabaizire kujura emitumbi, bashanga Sauli n'abatabani bafire aha Ibanga lya Giliboa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamujura, batwara omutwegwe n'ebikwatobye. Batuma entumwa omuli Filisitia yona, kumanyisa ebihuuku byabo n'abantu amakuru garungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebikwatobye babiteka rwensinga ya baruhanga babo, n'omutwegwe bakuhanika omuli rwensinga ya dagoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai orwo Yabeshigileadi yona yahuliire byona eby'Abafilisiti bakozire Sauli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abaisherukare bona emanzi baimuka, baija kutwara omutumbi gwa Sauli n'ey'abatabani. Bagileta Yabeshi. Baziika amagufa gabo aha mwaloni omuli Yabeshi, bamara basiiba ebiro mushanju.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo Sauli yafire atyo aha rw'okuburwa obwesigwa aha Mukama, tiyahikize mihangoye. Kandi yashuba yagya aha mbandwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaburwa kwehanuza aha Mukama. Nikwo Omukama kumwita n'obukama akabuha Daudi mutabani wa Yese.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
